\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Multi-seed intent accuracy (mean$\pm $std, 3 seeds; MASSIVE 2 seeds). With only 3 seeds we report descriptive statistics rather than an inferential test: no clear separation between depth-3 and depth-12 is observed on ATIS/SNIPS/CLINC150, while MASSIVE and BANKING77 show a small, seed-robust advantage for depth 12. Every depth-3 config is $\sim $4$\times $ faster.}}{7}{table.6}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Depth Pareto (ours). Accuracy peaks around depth 6--9 then plateaus; latency is $\sim $linear in depth. Intent accuracy / slot F1 / P50 ms.}}{7}{table.7}\protected@file@percent }
